WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Day one is a check, not a lesson.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:05.207
It finds the reason your child is not blending yet.

3
00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:10.606
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the letters and the words.

4
00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:12.235
There are three parts.

5
00:00:12.685 --> 00:00:17.163
Part A. Point to each letter on your child's page. Your child says its sound.

6
00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:21.427
You are listening for the sound, not the name of the letter. Like this.

7
00:00:25.749 --> 00:00:30.917
Part B. No page. You say the sounds of a word slowly, and your child says the word.

8
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:32.341
Say it like this.

9
00:00:38.009 --> 00:00:39.024
The word is map.

10
00:00:39.924 --> 00:00:43.135
Part C. Your child tries the four words on their page.

11
00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:47.154
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just listen and tick.

12
00:00:47.604 --> 00:00:53.395
Then read the box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits your child.

13
00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:57.062
That line is the reason. It tells you which days to do.

14
00:00:57.512 --> 00:01:00.537
Keep this page. You will look at it again on the last day.
